   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the highway law, in relation to designating a portion of the\nstate highway system as the \"Detective Sergeant Frank Gualdino Memorial\nBridge\"",
    "basePrintNo": "S8121",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S8121-2023",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [
      {
       "alternate": false,
       "chamber": "SENATE",
       "districtCode": 37,
       "fullName": "Shelley Mayer",
       "imgName": "623_shelley_mayer.jpg",
       "incumbent": true,
       "memberId": 1143,
       "sessionMemberId": 2024,
       "sessionYear": 2023,
       "shortName": "MAYER"
      }
     ],
     "size": 1
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Add §344-q, Hway L",
    "lawSection": "Highway Law",
    "memo": " \nBILL NUMBER: S8121\n\nSPONSOR: STEWART-COUSINS\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend the highway law, in relation to designating a portion of\nthe state highway system as the \"Detective Sergeant Frank Gualdino Memo-\nrial Bridge\"\n\n \nPURPOSE:\n\nThe purpose of this bill is to designate a portion of the state highway\nin Yonkers, New York in honor of fallen Yonkers Police Department offi-\ncer Detective Sergeant Frank Gualdino.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1 of the bill renames the portion of the Tuckahoe Road overpass\ncrossing the Sprain Brook Parkway in Yonkers to the \"Detective Sergeant\nFrank Gualdino Memorial Bridge.\"\n\nSection 2 directs the commissioner of transportation to provide for the\ninstallation and maintenance of adequate ceremonial signage.\n\nSection 3 is the effective date.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nDetective Sergeant Frank Gualdino's life was tragically cut short in a\ncollision on the Tuckahoe road overpass over the Sprain Brook Parkway on\nDecember 1, 2022. He dedicated 24 years of unwavering service to the\nYonkers Police Department, leaving an indelible mark through his assign-\nments in the 3rd Precinct, Traffic Court, and the Traffic/Motorcycle\nUnit. Whether tackling minor tasks or monumental responsibilities,\nDetective Sergeant Gualdino approached his duties with unparalleled\ngrace, enthusiasm, and unwavering dedication. His commitment extended\nbeyond the badge; it was a statement to his profound love for his\ncareer, city, and cherished family. Detective Sergeant Gualdino's legacy\nof loyalty and devotion merits profound recognition from the state of\nNew York.\n\n \nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nThis is a new bill.\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nTo be determined.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n",
